  "title": "Hexcel Schedules Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Release and Conference Call",
  "summary": "Hexcel Corporation (NYSE: HXL) announced today that it will report financial results for its second quarter of 2026 on Wednesday, July 29 after the market close. The company will host a webcast and conference call to discuss highlights of its financial results on Thursday, July 30 at 9:30 a.m. ET. The call will be hosted by Chairman, CEO and President Tom Gentile and Chief Financial Officer Jamie Coogan. The event will be webcast via the Investor Relations webpage at www.Hexcel.com . The event c",
